:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the Enemy Unit, see [[Mobius (Enemy)]].''
'''Mobius''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] and can be unlocked by rolling the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Crash Fever Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 326
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Mobius
|name2 = Miraculous Mobius
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Miraculous Mobius''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Mobius does a pretty good job against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies, standing at a good range, dealing decent DPS against them as well, in addition to knocking them back to gain breathing space, as some Red enemies like [[J.K. Bun Bun]], [[Bore]], [[One Horn]] and [[Capy]] are quite tanky and hard to knock back. This can, however, be bad in situations where they are backed up by backliners such as [[Professor A.]] or [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]].

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Backliner}}

